# HiVi frontend

- API base URL: `utils/auth.js` → `getApiUrl()` / `REACT_APP_API_URL`
- User session: `localStorage` (`hivi_user`, `token`)
- Design tokens: `App.css` `:root` — match dark/gold/purple patterns
- `PostCard` = mock editor profiles; `reddit/RedditPostCard` = Reddit posts
- Backend API contracts: see `docs/Backend_Flow.md` § API reference

After new API integrations, update `docs/Backend_Flow.md` if endpoints or auth rules change.
